  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 300 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "In a large Dutch oven, heat the olive oil over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is softened and lightly browned.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the lamb shoulder and cook until it is browned on all sides.",
    "Add the ume-plum paste, cumin, coriander, cayenne pepper, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Cover the Dutch oven and transfer it to the preheated oven.",
    "Roast the lamb for 2.5 hours, or until it is tender and falls apart easily.",
    "Remove the Dutch oven from the oven and let it cool slightly.",
    "Serve the lamb hot, garnished with fresh herbs if desired."
  ],
